:''Not to be confused with the PC exclusive [[Issun Boushi (PC Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Issun Boshi''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] gacha event. He was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] increases attack power and speed and gains [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze Immunity]].

