==Trivia==
*Issun Boshi is based on the fairy tale "[[wikipedia:Issun-bōshi|Issun-bōshi]]", in which an inch-tall samurai gets swallowed by an oni, but escapes by stabbing it in the stomach with a needle, then later marries a girl it kidnapped.
*Oni Landshaker Kozuchimaru is based on the [https://www.uboatworx.com/model/c-explorer C-explorer 3 subermersible], evidenced by the ONI-03 written on the side.
*Oni Landshaker/Battlepod Kozuchimaru's knockback animations are one of the few to be animated, as seen when the headlights flicker during its first few frames.

